    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1915" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">allector</span></b> , ōris, m.
		2. allĕgo. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>One that chooses others into a college</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell. 779</span></i>;
			<i><span class="en">2406</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A deputy under the emperors</i>, <i>who collected the taxes in the provinces</i>, Inscr Orell.
			369; 3654.</div>
